# Historical campaign evidence: bulky media & logs are traces, not source of truth.
# Curated release evidence (e.g. ENTREGA-20261021 PDFs/capturas) is force-added
# with `git add -f` when it is the explicit deliverable of a phase.
hospital-ai/**/*.log
